		"name": "Maya Admin Panel - Updated Complete API Collection",
		"description": "Updated comprehensive collection of all Maya Platform Admin APIs (131+ endpoints)\n\n## 🚀 UPDATED & READY TO TEST!\nThis collection includes all implemented backend endpoints:\n- ✅ All missing endpoints added from backend analysis\n- ✅ Endpoint URLs aligned with backend implementation\n- ✅ Realistic request bodies and examples\n- ✅ Pre-configured environment variables\n- ✅ Sample data for immediate testing\n- ✅ Authentication flow with token management\n\n## Features Included:\n- 🔐 Authentication (5 endpoints)\n- 👥 User Management (12 endpoints) \n- 📅 Booking Management (7 endpoints)\n- 💳 Payment Management (10 endpoints)\n- ⭐ Review Management (7 endpoints)\n- 🎨 Artist Verification (6 endpoints)\n- 🚀 Promotions & Marketing (12 endpoints)\n- 🎧 Support Management (15 endpoints)\n- 📊 Analytics & Reports (8 endpoints)\n- ⚙️ System Configuration (17 endpoints)\n- 👥 Admin User Management (13 endpoints)\n- 🏢 Business Management (12 endpoints)\n- 👤 Customer Management (8 endpoints)\n- 🏪 Provider Management (7 endpoints)\n- 💰 Financial Management (22 endpoints)\n\n## Updates in This Version:\n- Added 22 missing endpoints from backend implementation\n- Fixed endpoint URL alignment\n- Added system configuration endpoints\n- Enhanced admin user management\n- Expanded support management capabilities\n- Added financial management endpoints\n\n## Quick Start:\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Run 'Admin Login' to authenticate\n3. Start testing any endpoint immediately!\n\n## All Variables Pre-Configured:\n- Server URL, credentials, and sample IDs included\n- Realistic test data in request bodies\n- No external files or database setup needed",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "maya-admin-collection-updated"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🔐 Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Admin Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Test for successful login",
									"pm.test('Login successful', function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"",
									"// Extract and save token",
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    try {",
									"        const responseJson = pm.response.json();",
									"        let token = null;",
									"        ",
									"        if (responseJson.success && responseJson.data && responseJson.data.access_token) {",
									"            token = responseJson.data.access_token;",
									"        } else if (responseJson.access_token) {",
									"            token = responseJson.access_token;",
									"        }",
									"        ",
									"        if (token) {",
									"            pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', token);",
									"            console.log('✅ Access token saved');",
									"        }",
									"    } catch (error) {",
									"        console.error('Error extracting token:', error);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}"
						},
